Position":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A Waregeist that manifested when it was infected by Sui-Xiang. Crystalline and adorned with engravings of dragons and phoenixes, a Waregeist of this type is mysterious and imposing in nature, though it is also extremely irritable in temperament and very aggressive.","abilities":["After several attacks, inflicts continuous Arts damage that slowly increases over time (can be Resisted)","Spawns 1 <Porcelain Vase> when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":570,"def":450,"res":65,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"sharpedge":{"slug":"sharpedge","name":"Sharpedge","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sharpedge.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Waregeist that manifested when it was infected by Sui-Xiang. The weaponry yet again dreams of the past. A Waregeist of this type rouses its old memories as though it is taking to the battlefield again. Its strength is doubled as it and its peers rally each other.","abilities":["Consumes Broken Blades to gain increased ATK","When defeated, each unconsumed Broken Blade will spawn a <Iron Spearhead> (minimum 1)"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.3,"stats":{"hp":14000,"atk":1350,"def":750,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.2}},"left_claw_of_sui":{"slug":"left_claw_of_sui","name":"Left Claw of Sui","icon":"/enemies-icons/Left Claw of Sui.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":null,"abilities":["[Hidden Moon] and [Shrouded Sun] are cast together; lifts Left Claw of Sui and attacks the eastmost ally after a delay, dealing heavy Physical damage to all allies in the area","Sui's RES is reduced when weakened by a suppression pillar, and Its Left Claw will no longer use [Hidden Moon]"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":400000,"atk":900,"def":2000,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":0.1}},"right_claw_of_sui":{"slug":"right_claw_of_sui","name":"Right Claw of Sui","icon":"/enemies-icons/Right Claw of Sui.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":null,"abilities":["[Shrouded Sun] and [Hidden Moon] are cast together; lifts Right Claw of Sui and attacks the westmost ally after a delay, dealing heavy Physical damage to all allies in the area","Sui's DEF is reduced when weakened by a suppression pillar, and Its Right Claw will no longer use [Shrouded Sun]"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":400000,"atk":900,"def":2000,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":0.2}},"sui_enemy_1582_suisho":{"slug":"sui_enemy_1582_suisho","name":"Sui","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sui.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"The final god felled by Yan has risen again. It raises Its head and sees time immemorial from beginning to end, but It has never truly dwelled in the mortal realm.","abilities":["The four body parts share an HP pool and cast skills in order; individual body parts leave the battlefield after taking a certain amount of damage","Parts are lifted when skills are used, preventing them from being attacked, and the tiles they are on become deployable and passable","Bringing a body part under the influence of a suppression pillar weakens the corresponding stats and skills; Sui gains a large stat bonus and takes less Physical and Arts damage when it is at full strength","[Wrath of Eons] Raises Sui's Head and breathes fire at the northmost ally after a delay, dealing Arts damage and inflicting Burn; flames spread southwards and continues to burn in an area, dealing Arts damage, inflicting Burn, and igniting <'Unquenched'>; remains on the field for a while","[Sundered Pillars] When HP falls below a certain point, summons extra enemies, and the 4 body parts simultaneously cast [Wrath of Eons], [Hidden Moon], [Shrouded Sun], and [Order Overturned]","Sui's ATK is reduced when weakened by a suppression pillar, and [Wrath of Eons] range is reduced"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":400000,"atk":900,"def":1600,"res":50,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"tail_of_sui":{"slug":"tail_of_sui","name":"Tail of Sui","icon":"/enemies-icons/Tail of Sui.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":null,"abilities":["[Order Overturned] Lifts Tail of Sui and attacks the southmost ally after a delay, dealing Physical damage to all allies in the area three times; spawns <'Unquenched'> based on the number of allies defeated this way","Sui's HP is reduced when weakened by a suppression pillar, and range and damage of [Order Overturned] are reduced"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":400000,"atk":900,"def":2000,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":0.3}},"dazzled_smarty":{"slug":"dazzled_smarty","name":"Dazzled 'Smarty'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dazzled 'Smarty'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A strange Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. Seems to be alive. Very lively with its movements and likes to wander around. It explodes if it touches any fellow Ink Spirits with opposite attributes, so any survivors tend to be even more powerful.","abilities":["Can only be blocked by player's units of the same attribute.","Explodes upon death, dealing Arts damage to friendly units. Causes even greater damage if similar units of the opposite attribute are in its vicinity"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":3700,"atk":150,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"wield_arms_oppress":{"slug":"wield_arms_oppress","name":"Wield Arms - Oppress","icon":"/enemies-icons/Wield Arms - Oppress.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Scriptgeist driven mad from the influence of Sui, whose original name was 'Soldier'. The histories write: 'Upon the peaks was the beast cornered and killed.' It was the battlefield where the Feranmut was hunted, and where countless soldiers were buried. Swords and spears lie buried, and tears of blood have stopped flowing. The bleached bones shall know spring no more.","abilities":["Vanishes when encountering another type of enemy, granting the target a portion of this unit's ATK, DEF, and RES, stacking up to 3 times per unit"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":5400,"atk":500,"def":250,"res":5,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"draw_bow_screech":{"slug":"draw_bow_screech","name":"Draw Bow - Screech","icon":"/enemies-icons/Draw Bow - Screech.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Scriptgeist driven mad from the influence of Sui, whose original name was 'Bow'. The histories write: 'Where does the bowstring return, across thousands of miles to the Pass?' Every goodbye on that bridge was solemn and earnest. The sandstorm rages, and the bowstring wails, yet its bearer is nowhere to be seen, but for the lingering echoes of the string's ring.","abilities":["Hits 3 times","Prioritizes attacking allies on Glyph Tiles"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":9000,"atk":210,"def":150,"res":5,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"ribbon_in_the_waves_rust":{"slug":"ribbon_in_the_waves_rust","name":"Ribbon in the Waves - Rust","icon":"/enemies-icons/Ribbon in the Waves - Rust.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Scriptgeist driven mad from the influence of Sui, whose original name was 'Falsehood'. 'He who claims himself pure should be cast into murky waters.' Purity and corruption, truth and falsehood, are never easy to tell. Who can tell if the words of the swimming fins are true?","abilities":["Can move through empty Glyph Tiles","Exits glyph form when stamped by a Stamp, becoming stunned, and cannot turn back to glyph form for a while","Cannot be teleported"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":50000,"atk":650,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2.5}},"shanhaizhong_oracle":{"slug":"shanhaizhong_oracle","name":"Shanhaizhong Oracle","icon":"/enemies-icons/Shanhaizhong Oracle.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Shanhaizhong members who can cast strange Arts. They superstitiously believe in those huge beings and resent their own compatriots, shouting 'the mounts, seas, and all in between shall be our master's' while displaying a 'divine power' of unknown origin.","abilities":["Continuously locks on to a target and inflicts a large burst of Arts damage after the channel completes, gaining increased ASPD afterwards"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":13000,"atk":500,"def":250,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"indefatigable_blindey":{"slug":